{"id": "989f2cf3-75df-4a8a-95fc-4f3d1a93264a", "name": "TWin/TWout推定制御制約", "description": "提示された劣化量データと環境温度等をもとに、TWin（許容入力制限）およびTWout（許容出力制限）の推定制御値を算出します。", "inputNames": ["degradation_rate", "ambient_temperature"], "outputNames": ["control_output_tw"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# 入力された内部・外部の温度変化率と劣化状態から、TWin/TWout推定制御出力を決定する\ncontrol_output_tw = (ambient_temperature * 0.4) + (degradation_rate * 0.6)", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T12:30:48.546035", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
